```
### Gameplay & Interaction Details

- **Flip mechanics:** Each card is a button that flips to reveal its emoji face. You can only have two cards face-up at a time, and clicking the same card again is ignored.
- **Matching and feedback:** When two flipped cards match, they get a green highlight and stay face-up. If they don’t match, both flip back after a short delay. The move counter increases with every pair you flip.
- **Win condition:** Once all eight pairs are matched, a congratulatory message appears with your total move count.
- **Reshuffle:** The Shuffle button resets the board, reshuffles the deck, and clears the move counter, so you can start a fresh round instantly.
---

**Optimization Tip:** You can swap the emoji list in the `SYMBOLS` array to use your own icons or images; just keep eight unique items. The mismatch flip-back delay is set to 800ms and can be adjusted.

